# ============================================================
# Governance HQ repository
# Tracks ONLY the requirements/compliance system. All product
# projects living beside it in this workspace are intentionally
# untracked here (they get their own repos).
#
# Pattern: ignore everything at root, then whitelist the
# governance set explicitly.
# ============================================================

/*

# --- governance core ---
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md

# --- requirements library ---
!/docs/
!/docs/requirements/
!/docs/requirements/**

# --- automation ---
!/scripts/
!/scripts/*.ps1

# --- local junk never wanted anywhere ---
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
